<title>BELGIUM: Immobel swings to 30.3 mln Bfr H1 profit.</title>
<headline>Immobel swings to 30.3 mln Bfr H1 profit.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996 (in millions of Belgian francs unless stated):</p>
<p>    Group net profit/loss		30.26  vs    42.46 loss</p>
<p>    Cons turnover/sales (bln)	   3.89  vs     5.08</p>
<p>    Cons operating profit	     164.26  vs   153.85</p>
<p>    Cons current profit		  85.89  vs    69.42</p>
<p>    Cons extraordinary profit/loss    2.32  vs     9.42 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Cie. Immobiliere de Belgique SA (Immobel) is a Belgian property company. It is around 30 percent owned by Belgian holding company Tractebel SA.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
